Player Home Cast 1a Start
    Events
        Unit - A unit owned by Player 1 (Red) Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to Return Home (Traveler's Journal)
    Actions
        -------- ================================= --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
            Then - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Remaining time for PlayerHomeCooldown) Equal to 0.00
                        (Remaining time for PlayerHomeCastTimer) Equal to 0.00
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- Stop the caster and prepare for teleport --------
                        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeCaster = (Triggering unit)
                        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of PlayerHomeCaster)
                        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units within 900.00 of VarPoint.) and do (Actions)
                            Loop - Actions
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Not equal to Stash
                                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Not equal to Bag
                                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Not equal to Companions
                                        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                            Conditions
                                                (Owner of (Picked unit)) Equal to (Owner of PlayerHomeCaster)
                                                ((Picked unit) is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
                                                ((Picked unit) is in TamedUnits.) Equal to True
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Unit Group - Add (Picked unit) to PlayerHomeGroup
                                    Else - Actions
                        -------- ================================= --------
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                        -------- ================================= --------
                        Cinematic - Ping minimap for (All players) at PlayerHomeLocation for 10.00 seconds
                        Countdown Timer - Start PlayerHomeCastTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 10.00 seconds
                        Unit - Order PlayerHomeCaster to Stop.
                        -------- We want to prevent the "caster" to not aggro nearby hostile units during the cast, unless the player itself commands --------
                        Unit - Set PlayerHomeCaster acquisition range to 0.00
                        -------- Adding and forcing the caster unit to cast Return Home --------
                        Unit - Add Return Home (Fake cast) to PlayerHomeCaster
                        Unit - Order PlayerHomeCaster to Human Priest - Inner Fire PlayerHomeCaster
                        Unit - For PlayerHomeCaster, Ability Return Home (Fake cast), Hide ability: True
                        Animation - Play PlayerHomeCaster's spell ready 2 animation
                        -------- Turn on Check & Ready triggers --------
                        Trigger - Turn on Player Home Cast 1b Actions During Teleportation <gen>
                        Trigger - Turn on Player Home Cast 1c Any Command During Teleportation <gen>
                        Trigger - Turn on Player Home Cast 2 Ready <gen>
                        -------- ----------------- --------
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: |cFFFFCC00Traveler'...
                        Trigger - Run Hint 8 Travelers Journal 4 <gen> (checking conditions)
                        -------- ================================= --------
                    Else - Actions
                        -------- ================================= --------
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: (|cFFFFCC00Traveler's Journal|r|cFFFFFFFF: You will have to wait for |r + ((String((Integer((Remaining time for PlayerHomeCooldown))))) + |cFFFFFFFF seconds until you can return home.|r))
                        -------- ================================= --------
            Else - Actions
                -------- ================================= --------
                Trigger - Run Hint 7 Travelers Journal 3 <gen> (checking conditions)
                -------- ================================= --------
